 Platoon Commander Answer Key 2026?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer. </strong>You can check it on the official RPSC website: rpsc.rajasthan.gov.in</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. What should I search on the website to find the RPSC SI / Platoon Commander Answer Key 2026?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer.</strong> Look for&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"731\" data-end=\"797\">“Answer Key – RPSC SI / Platoon Commander Recruitment 2025”</strong> in the notifications list.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. What details are required to download the Answer Key?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer.</strong>&nbsp;Candidates need their&nbsp;<strong>Application Number / DOB</strong>&nbsp;and<strong>&nbsp;Captcha</strong> to download the answer key<strong>.</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. What is RPSC Official Website?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer. </strong>The Official Website of RPSC is https://rpsc.rajasthan.gov.in/news</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
